%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([User opens page]) --> ReadLS[Read currency<br/>from localStorage]
    ReadLS --> HasPref{Preference<br/>saved?}
    HasPref -->|Yes| UseSaved[Use saved currency]
    HasPref -->|No| DefaultBRL[Default to BRL]
    UseSaved --> FetchAPI
    DefaultBRL --> FetchAPI

    FetchAPI[API call with<br/>?currency=X] --> Backend{Backend<br/>processing}

    Backend --> IsBRL{currency<br/>== BRL?}
    IsBRL -->|Yes| ReturnRaw[Return raw BRL prices]
    IsBRL -->|No| LookupRate[Look up exchange rate<br/>for observation date]
    LookupRate --> HasRate{Rate<br/>found?}
    HasRate -->|Yes| Convert[Divide BRL price<br/>by rate]
    HasRate -->|No| ReturnNull[Return null price]
    Convert --> ReturnConverted[Return USD price]

    ReturnRaw --> Render[Render prices<br/>with formatCurrency]
    ReturnConverted --> Render
    ReturnNull --> Render

    Render --> Display([Display page])

    Display --> Toggle{User clicks<br/>currency toggle?}
    Toggle -->|Yes| UpdateLS[Update localStorage<br/>+ cross-tab sync]
    UpdateLS --> FetchAPI
    Toggle -->|No| End([Done])

    classDef startEnd fill:#164e63,stroke:#06b6d4,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef decision fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#e2e8f0
    classDef action fill:#1c1917,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fbbf24
    classDef api fill:#3f1e5f,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#e2e8f0

    class Start,Display,End startEnd
    class HasPref,IsBRL,HasRate,Toggle decision
    class ReadLS,UseSaved,DefaultBRL,LookupRate,Convert,ReturnRaw,ReturnConverted,ReturnNull,UpdateLS,Render action
    class FetchAPI,Backend api
